-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §49 הליך פיטורים פדגוגיים: a permanent
-- teaching employee is dismissed for pedagogical reasons by the Ministry of
-- Education's procedure annexed as annex ה'.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-h`

§ `49 הליך פיטורים פדגוגיים`

-- ¶1: the procedure for the pedagogical dismissal of permanent teaching
-- employees is the Ministry of Education's, annexed as annex ה' ("הליך
-- הפסקת עבודה של מורה קבוע בבעלות מטעמים פדגוגיים"). The section speaks of
-- permanent teaching employees only. The procedure is encoded in annex
-- ה's own file (oz-founding-annex-h): it begins where the evaluation model
-- finds significant pedagogical faults.
@ref akn:art_49/p1
DECLARE `procedure for an Oz pedagogical dismissal` IS ONE OF
    `the Ministry's procedure annexed as annex ה'`

GIVEN `a permanent teaching employee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `procedure for an Oz pedagogical dismissal`
DECIDE `the pedagogical dismissal procedure section 49 sets for` `a permanent teaching employee` IS
    IF `a permanent teaching employee`
    THEN JUST `the Ministry's procedure annexed as annex ה'`
    ELSE NOTHING

#ASSERT `the pedagogical dismissal procedure section 49 sets for` TRUE EQUALS JUST `the Ministry's procedure annexed as annex ה'`
#ASSERT `the pedagogical dismissal procedure section 49 sets for` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `annex ה's procedure begins` TRUE
